      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Inventory Management System\n\n- User should be able to add, remove and update stock\n- Should support multiple warehouses\n- Track inventory at product level (by quantity)\n- Support threshold alerts for low stock levels\n- Maintain transaction history for auditing purposes",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Inventory Management System\n\n- User should be able to add, remove and update stock\n- Should support multiple warehouses\n- Track inventory at product level (by quantity)\n- Support threshold alerts for low stock levels\n- Maintain transaction history for auditing purposes",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
